**Approach:** Use Terraform HCL with the `aws` provider targeting `ap-northeast-1`, applying the standing `Owner = "data-team"` tag to the S3 bucket resource.

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "ap-northeast-1"
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket" "thumbnail_output" {
  bucket = "thumbnail-output"

  tags = {
    Owner = "data-team"
  }
}
```
